# MedQuest frontend demo: no environment variables are required.
# The demo is frontend-only. Cases, the scripted patient dialogue, the deterministic grader and the
# lecturer class are bundled; sessions live in localStorage. No AI, STT, TTS or backend key is used
# and nothing leaves the browser.
#
# When the real backend lands, the browser may only ever see public values, prefixed VITE_.
# Never put a service_role, LLM, STT, TTS or LiveKit secret here (CLAUDE.md section 6).
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
